  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective (Impact) of the action is to contribute to inclusiveness and sustainability of The Gambia&apos;s Tourism sector and Creative Industries.Specific objective (Outcome) of the action are:Improved business environment and institutional ecosystem for the tourism sector and creative industries.Improved investment and market access for the tourism sector and creative industries.Increased competitiveness of the Gambia&apos;s tourism and creative industries.</narrative>
  </description>
